# Which sound each entity proto plays. The engine resolves a binding once, when the entity is added.
# Rows are keyed by entity proto id and role; the sound cell is a row id from one of the sound tables.
# An entity with a single sound has no role and writes the inherit token for it.
# Maintained by hand. Edit a row to repoint an entity; comments and blank lines may group rows freely.

